  "body": "My feeling is that 'All' in getAll\\* methods is overkill.\n\nI would then replace all of getAll\\* by get*, e.g.:\n- `BluetoothDevice.getServices`\n- `BluetoothGATTService.getCharacteristics`\n- `BluetoothGATTService.getIncludedServices`\n- `BluetoothGATTCharacteristic.getDescriptors`\n\nThis would also be aligned with most existing native APIs (e.g. [Android](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/bluetooth/BluetoothGatt.html))\n",
